export function CategoryGroup({name,count,onEdit,children}:{name:string;count:number;onEdit:()=>void;children:ReactNode}){const [expanded,setExpanded]=useState(false);return <View style={{borderBottomWidth:1,borderBottomColor:C.line}}><View style={{flexDirection:'row',alignItems:'center',gap:5,paddingVertical:12}}><TouchableOpacity accessibilityRole="button" accessibilityLabel={'Expandir '+name} onPress={()=>setExpanded(!expanded)} style={{flex:1,minHeight:44,justifyContent:'center'}}><Text style={[u.rowTitle,{fontWeight:'600'}]}>{name}</Text></TouchableOpacity><Text style={u.small}>{count} subcategorias</Text><IconButton icon="edit" label={'Editar '+name} onPress={onEdit}/><TouchableOpacity accessibilityRole="button" accessibilityLabel={'Expandir subcategorias de '+name} onPress={()=>setExpanded(!expanded)} style={{width:24,height:44,alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'center'}}><RotatingChevron expanded={expanded}/></TouchableOpacity></View>{expanded&&children}</View>}
